      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic</title>

    <para>Prepare Xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic for compilation:</para>

      <para>Now Configure the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="configure">sed -i 's|@libexecdir@/|/usr/libexec/|' \
  data/org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.cosmic.service.in \
  data/dbus-1/org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.cosmic.service.in
</userinput></screen>

      <para>To Compile the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">export VERGEN_GIT_COMMIT_DATE='Tue Oct 20 13:45:17 2026 -0600' &amp;&amp;
export VERGEN_GIT_SHA=f448ddfb296bf7bb23517b24b2f532559a334a1c &amp;&amp;
cargo build --release --no-default-features</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic \
        /usr/libexec/xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.cosmic.service.in \
  /usr/lib/systemd/user/org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.cosmic.service &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/dbus-1/org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.cosmic.service.in \
  /usr/share/dbus-1/services/org.freedesktop.impl.portal.desktop.cosmic.service &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/cosmic.portal /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal/portals &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 data/cosmic-portals.conf /usr/share/xdg-desktop-portal &amp;&amp;

cp -rv data/icons/. /usr/share/icons/hicolor/</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

